# UI details

## Concentric radii

When a rounded child sits 8px or less inside a rounded parent, its radius is the parent's radius minus the gap.

```css
/* Bad: 10px inside a 16px card with 4px padding */
.main { border-radius: var(--ds-radius-lg); }

/* Good: 16 - 4 = 12 */
.main { border-radius: var(--ds-radius-xl); }
```

## Icons sit on the first line

An icon or dot beside multi-line text centers on the first line, not the whole block. Wrap it in a box one line tall.

```css
/* Bad: the row centers the dot between the title and its detail */
.row { align-items: center; }

/* Good */
.marker {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  align-self: flex-start;
  height: var(--ds-leading-body);
}
```
